{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Six Chambers</strong> is a poker-inspired roguelike deckbuilder where every fired bullet is decided by the hand you choose. Using traditional Texas Hold\u2019em rules, you speculate between six possible hands, weighing the risks, and making sure to not lose your marbles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat enemies to unlock new cards and abilities that let you manipulate the board and tilt the odds in your favor. Your deck is your edge: use it to weaken rival chambers while strengthening your own, shaping each round to ultimately confront The Ranger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625260/extras/88d090c579d957a329e481b5cc859c58.poster.avif?t=1773551365\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625260/extras/88d090c579d957a329e481b5cc859c58.webm?t=1773551365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625260/extras/88d090c579d957a329e481b5cc859c58.mp4?t=1773551365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625260/extras/1e6de710c9fc8b17678f9f9ea1f88874.poster.avif?t=1773551365\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625260/extras/1e6de710c9fc8b17678f9f9ea1f88874.webm?t=1773551365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625260/extras/1e6de710c9fc8b17678f9f9ea1f88874.mp4?t=1773551365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steams